# Public website — build-time configuration
#
# Read during `astro build` only. Nothing here reaches the browser except
# SITE_URL.
#
# There is no CMS URL and no read token. Content and media come from the
# content directory in this repository, so a build needs the checkout it is
# already running in and nothing else.

# Canonical origin of the published site; used for sitemaps and og:url.
SITE_URL=http://localhost:4321
